<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3582_14286.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>beÿ demselben, sonderen hat an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>
